---
import { existsSync } from "node:fs";
import { fileURLToPath } from "node:url";
import release from "../data/release.json";

const apkLocal = fileURLToPath(new URL("../../public/BreakFree.apk", import.meta.url));
// Serve the APK same-origin when the build fetched it — mobile browsers
// handle that far better than GitHub's redirect chain. If the fetch failed,
// fall back to the release PAGE (not the direct download URL), so the
// visitor lands on GitHub and can pick the file manually.
const apkHref = existsSync(apkLocal)
  ? "/BreakFree.apk"
  : "https://github.com/YUouriii/taafi-app/releases/latest";
const mb = (release.size / 1048576).toFixed(1);
---

<section class="section cta" id="source">
  <div class="container cta__inner">
    <p class="section-label" data-reveal>
      <span class="t-en">Day one</span>
      <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">اليوم الأول</span>
    </p>
    <h2 class="cta__title" data-reveal style="--d:.06s">
      <span class="t-en">
        Day one is a<br /><em>download away.</em>
      </span>
      <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">
        اليوم الأول على بُعد<br /><em>تحميل واحد.</em>
      </span>
    </h2>
    <p
      class="cta__ar"
      lang="ar"
      dir="rtl"
      data-reveal
      style="--d:.1s"
      aria-label="The first day, in Arabic: al-yawm al-awwal"
    >
      اليوم الأول
    </p>

    <div class="cta__actions" data-reveal style="--d:.14s">
      <a
        class="btn btn--solid"
        href={apkHref}
        download="BreakFree.apk"
        data-apk-dl
      >
        <span class="t-en">Download the APK</span>
        <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">حمّل الـ <span class="lat" lang="en" dir="ltr">APK</span></span>
      </a>
      <a
        class="btn btn--ghost"
        href="https://github.com/YUouriii/taafi-app"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="t-en">Source on GitHub</span>
        <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">المصدر على GitHub</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p
      class="cta__version mono"
      data-reveal
      style="--d:.15s"
      data-build-tag={release.tag}
    >
      <span class="t-en">Latest release: {release.tag} · {mb} MB</span>
      <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">آخر إصدار: {release.tag} · {mb} MB</span>
    </p>

    <p class="cta__install" data-reveal style="--d:.16s">
      <span class="t-en">
        You know what Android will say when you open it, because you read
        the guide first. After downloading, allow the one-time &ldquo;install
        from unknown sources&rdquo; prompt — then it's on your phone. The APK
        is built from the public source; this site ships nothing extra.
      </span>
      <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">
        أنت تعرف ما سيقوله أندرويد عند الفتح، لأنك قرأت الدليل أولًا. بعد
        التنزيل، اسمح مرة واحدة بالتثبيت من مصادر غير معروفة — وينتهي
        الأمر. والـ
        <span class="lat" lang="en" dir="ltr">APK</span> يُبنى من المصدر
        العام؛ وهذا الموقع لا يضيف عليه شيئًا.
      </span>
      <a class="cta__install-link" href="#install">
        <span class="t-en">↑ Read the install guide again</span>
        <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">↑ ارجع إلى دليل التثبيت</span>
      </a>
    </p>

    <p class="cta__links mono" data-reveal style="--d:.18s">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/YUouriii/taafi-app/releases"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="t-en">All releases ↗</span>
        <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">كل الإصدارات ↗</span>
      </a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/YUouriii/taafi-app#readme"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="t-en">README</span>
        <span class="t-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl">الملف التفصيلي</span>
      </a>
    </p>

    <p class="cta__meta mono" data-reveal style="--d:.2s">
      Android 9+ · Kotlin · Jetpack Compose · Firebase · Open source
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    background: var(--paper-deep);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    text-align: center;
    transition: background-color 0.5s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .cta__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .cta__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 1.4rem + 6vw, 5.6rem);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
  }

  html[lang="ar"] .cta__title {
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .cta__ar {
    font-family: var(--font-arabic);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 1rem + 1.2vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--dawn-deep);
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
    transition: color 0.4s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .cta__ar:hover {
    color: var(--dawn);
  }

  .cta__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.6rem;
  }

  .cta__version {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .cta__version .t-ar {
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .cta__install {
    margin-top: 1.8rem;
    max-width: 52ch;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  html[lang="ar"] .cta__install {
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .cta__install-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dawn-deep);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    padding-bottom: 0.15em;
    transition: color 0.25s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .cta__install-link:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  html[lang="ar"] .cta__install-link {
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .cta__links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .cta__links a {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.25s var(--ease-out);
  }

  .cta__links a:hover {
    color: var(--dawn-deep);
  }

  .cta__meta {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
</style>
